**Security notes:**
- `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` and `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` are server-only (no `NEXT_PUBLIC_` prefix)
- Client receives only `NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY` (safe for browser)
- Checkout session created server-side after `getServerSession` verifies identity
- `client_reference_id` and `metadata.userId` bind session to authenticated user
- Request body validated with Zod schema before use
- Structured logging with user-controlled values as fields (CRLF-safe via JSON)
- No `dangerouslySetInnerHTML`, no inline scripts, CSP-compatible
